   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Imagine you are a school guidance counselor working with a group of teachers who are concerned about a student displaying both internalizing and externalizing behaviors. The teachers are unsure how to approach this student to support their mental health and promote resilience. Write a letter to the teachers outlining specific strategies they can use to address these behaviors, and explain how these strategies can help improve the student’s socioemotional well-being.",
